    ('h2', 'How to choose'),
    ('ul', ['<b>Structure needed?</b> Choose a woven: shirts, tailoring, structured dresses.', '<b>Movement and comfort?</b> Choose a knit: tees, activewear, loungewear.', '<b>Fitted without darts?</b> A knit or a stretch woven.', '<b>Sharp creases and pleats?</b> A woven with good memory.']),
    ('h2', 'Production tips'),
    ('p', 'Knits need stretch stitches or overlockers and careful handling to avoid distortion. Wovens fray, so seam finishing matters. Always test shrinkage on both before cutting bulk.'),
    ('cta', 'Browse weave and knit structures in the <a href="fabrics.html#weaves">Forecut fabric library</a>.'),
